### Invalid input — expect 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "123"
}

### Register a new user — expect 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nazar",
  "email": "nazar.registration.check01@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### Duplicate email — expect 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nazar",
  "email": "nazar.registration.check01@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### Register with mixed-case email — expect 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John",
  "email": "JohnBoB.Check01@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### Register the same email in lowercase — expect 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John",
  "email": "johnbob.check01@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}